{
  "$comment": [
    "MyType 设置契约：mytype.conf 里每一项的键名、类型、默认值、范围或可选值。",
    "改设置项（加键、改名、改默认值、改范围或可选值）要先改这里；macos/test.sh 拿它对照 macos/Sources/Shared/Config.swift 的 MyTypeConfig，对不上 CI 就挂。",
    "文件格式：一行一个 键=值，开关写 True / False，数字写十进制，值可以带双引号。",
    "default 是写进文件的值；platformDefault 是 macOS 故意不一样的默认值，why 写原因。",
    "platforms 是认这一项的端；没列的端不认这个键（读到了不管，写回时原样留着）。"
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "ends": {
    "macos": "macOS 输入法外壳（Swift），设置窗口和输入法共用 Shared/Config.swift"
  },
  "readRules": {
    "outOfRange": {
      "$comment": "数字超出 min–max 时夹到边上（PageSize=2 读成 3，=12 读成 9）。",
      "macos": "clamp"
    },
    "notes": [
      "开关只认 True / False（区分大小写），别的写法（true、1、yes）读出来是默认值。",
      "枚举区分大小写，认不出（写错、大小写不对、不认识的双拼方案）读出来是默认值。",
      "数字认不出（abc、空的）读出来是默认值。",
      "键和值两边的空格、Tab 不算（PageSize = 5 读成 5）。",
      "[分组] 下面的行（旧配置里的 [Hotkey] 等）不是设置项，不认，设置界面写回时原样留着。",
      "两边有双引号的值去掉引号，再把 \\\\、\\\"、\\n 还原（和写文件时的转义对应）。"
    ],
    "cases": {
      "$comment": "file 是整个 mytype.conf 的原文，expect 是读出来的值（写进文件的样子）。",
      "items": [
        {
          "file": "TypoCorrection=false\nTraditional=1\nFuzzy=yes",
          "expect": {
            "TypoCorrection": "True",
            "Traditional": "False",
            "Fuzzy": "False"
          }
        },
        {
          "file": "TypoCorrection=False\nTraditional=True",
          "expect": {
            "TypoCorrection": "False",
            "Traditional": "True"
          }
        },
        {
          "file": "ShuangpinScheme=xiaohe\nCandidateLayout=vertical\nShiftToggle=left",
          "expect": {
            "ShuangpinScheme": "Ziranma",
            "CandidateLayout": "Horizontal",
            "ShiftToggle": "Both"
          }
        },
        {
          "file": "ShuangpinScheme=Xiaohe\nCandidateLayout=Vertical\nShiftToggle=Left",
          "expect": {
            "ShuangpinScheme": "Xiaohe",
            "CandidateLayout": "Vertical",
            "ShiftToggle": "Left"
          }
        },
        {
          "file": "ShuangpinScheme=Dvorak\nTranslateTarget=EN\nSelectKeys=semicolon",
          "expect": {
            "ShuangpinScheme": "Ziranma",
            "TranslateTarget": "en",
            "SelectKeys": "Off"
          }
        },
        {
          "file": "ArrowKeys=caret",
          "expect": {
            "ArrowKeys": "Candidates"
          }
        },
        {
          "file": "ArrowKeys=Caret",
          "expect": {
            "ArrowKeys": "Caret"
          }
        },
        {
          "file": "PageSize=abc\nTranslateIdleMinutes=",
          "expect": {
            "PageSize": "9",
            "TranslateIdleMinutes": "5"
          }
        },
        {
          "file": "PageSize=12\nTranslateIdleMinutes=-3",
          "expect": {
            "PageSize": "9",
            "TranslateIdleMinutes": "0"
          }
        },
        {
          "file": "PageSize=5\n\n[Hotkey]\nPageSize=4\nTraditional=True",
          "expect": {
            "PageSize": "5",
            "Traditional": "False"
          }
        },
        {
          "file": "[Hotkey]\nTranslateLocal=False\nTranslateBaseUrl=https://a/v1",
          "expect": {
            "TranslateLocal": "True",
            "TranslateBaseUrl": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "file": "Lexicon=\"/Users/me/词库 \\\"新\\\"\\\\v2.tsv\"",
          "expect": {
            "Lexicon": "/Users/me/词库 \"新\"\\v2.tsv"
          }
        },
        {
          "file": "Lexicon=  /a/b.tsv  ",
          "expect": {
            "Lexicon": "/a/b.tsv"
          }
        },
        {
          "file": "  TypoCorrection = False\nPageSize\t=\t5",
          "expect": {
            "TypoCorrection": "False",
            "PageSize": "5"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "key": "CandidateLayout",
      "type": "enum",
      "default": "Horizontal",
      "values": [
        "Horizontal",
        "Vertical"
      ],
      "platforms": [
        "macos"
      ],
      "note": "候选排列：横排、竖排"
    },
    {
      "key": "ArrowKeys",
      "type": "enum",
      "default": "Candidates",
      "values": [
        "Candidates",
        "Caret"
      ],
      "platforms": [
        "macos"
      ],
      "note": "打字途中方向键做什么（#129）。Candidates：都用来挑候选，跟着候选排列（横排左右键选词、上键上一页、下键展开；竖排上下键选词、左右键翻页）。Caret：上下键选词，左右键在拼音里移动光标，字母插在光标处、退格删光标前一个，Home、End、Delete 也管光标；方向键不翻页，「译」里没有光标"
    },
    {
      "key": "PageSize",
      "type": "int",
      "default": 9,
      "min": 3,
      "max": 9,
      "platforms": [
        "macos"
      ],
      "note": "每页候选个数"
    },
    {
      "key": "CandidateFontSize",
      "type": "int",
      "default": 17,
      "min": 10,
      "max": 40,
      "platforms": [
        "macos"
      ],
      "note": "候选字号（磅）。"
    },
    {
      "key": "PageKeysMinusEqual",
      "type": "bool",
      "default": true,
      "platforms": [
        "macos"
      ],
      "note": "翻页键 - ="
    },
    {
