          "name": "双拼输入"
        },
        {
          "value": "Wubi86",
          "name": "五笔输入"
        }
      ],
      "platforms": [
        "macos"
      ],
      "note": "输入方案：全拼、双拼、五笔 86。五笔要数据目录里有 wubi86.tsv，没有时设置里五笔灰掉，照全拼打并提示。name 和 MyTypeConfig.InputScheme.name 对照（设置界面显示的名字）",
      "whenMissing": {
        "$comment": "文件里没有 InputScheme 这一行时：Shuangpin 是 True 就是 value，否则用 default。读文件时照这条规矩。Shuangpin 已经不是设置项：只在这里读，存盘时不写它，文件里有的那行下次存盘就没了。",
        "ifTrue": "Shuangpin",
        "value": "Shuangpin",
        "why": "0.3.12 及以前只有 Shuangpin 开关，升级后双拼用户接着用双拼",
        "cases": [
          {
            "file": {},
            "expect": "Quanpin"
          },
          {
            "file": {
              "Shuangpin": "True"
            },
            "expect": "Shuangpin"
          },
          {
            "file": {
              "Shuangpin": "False"
            },
            "expect": "Quanpin"
          },
          {
            "file": {
              "Shuangpin": "True",
              "InputScheme": "Wubi86"
            },
            "expect": "Wubi86"
          },
          {
            "file": {
              "Shuangpin": "True",
              "InputScheme": "Quanpin"
            },
            "expect": "Quanpin"
          },
          {
            "file": {
              "Shuangpin": "False",
              "InputScheme": "Shuangpin"
            },
            "expect": "Shuangpin"
          }
        ]
      }
